'''Aprica''' (from {{Langx|la|Aprica|4=sunny place}}; {{Langx|kp|Itá-Re'éndy|4={{W|Peninsula|rock tongue}}}}) is a mountainous coastal [[Regions of Balisca|region]] of [[Hesperia]], within the [[Balisca|Baliscan Confederation]]. It is bounded by the [[Salsipuedes Sea]] to the north and west, [[Basilisco]] to the southeast, and [[Trás-as-Montanyas]] and the [[Garrigàs Lake]] to the south. 

